{"1892420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Bunny Graveyard", "steam_appid": 1892420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/7403578dd58db110a9e0404819845248.poster.avif?t=1787620625\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/7403578dd58db110a9e0404819845248.webm?t=1787620625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/7403578dd58db110a9e0404819845248.mp4?t=1787620625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong> is a pixel art horror adventure where you play as a cursor that's been sucked into a digital world full of gardening, fishing, fighting championships and mysteries to solve. Immerse yourself in a world of pixel art inspired by GBA and NDS graphics, while unraveling an enthralling story that keeps you hooked!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/e72ee2806fe5cc28f866d1f537d48fca.avif?t=1787620625\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first chapter of this journey as... a <strong>cursor</strong>? Your job is to find Skye, the bunny! But there seems to be some kind of strange entity inside the computer that doesn't want you to leave... can you complete your task and survive? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/09c74586fdb8a83de64154b4b14e7311.avif?t=1787620625\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new areas and make friends! Some may become besties, or your worst <i>NIGHTMARE</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/97ffb91a00a3fba13260fe97771fc530.avif?t=1787620625\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fishing and gardening to underground fights, enjoy a variety of <i>FUN MINIGAMES</i>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/94b08009017fde8e6c9b2d2c96776f3b.avif?t=1787620625\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world... NOTHING is what it seems, and you must survive to uncover <i>the truth</i>. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices to experience different interactions! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-packed and creepy animated cutscenes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find COLLECTIBLES to uncover the hidden story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect FIGURINES of your favorite characters!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/7403578dd58db110a9e0404819845248.poster.avif?t=1787620625\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/7403578dd58db110a9e0404819845248.webm?t=1787620625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/7403578dd58db110a9e0404819845248.mp4?t=1787620625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong> is a pixel art horror adventure where you play as a cursor that's been sucked into a digital world full of gardening, fishing, fighting championships and mysteries to solve. Immerse yourself in a world of pixel art inspired by GBA and NDS graphics, while unraveling an enthralling story that keeps you hooked!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/e72ee2806fe5cc28f866d1f537d48fca.avif?t=1787620625\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first chapter of this journey as... a <strong>cursor</strong>? Your job is to find Skye, the bunny! But there seems to be some kind of strange entity inside the computer that doesn't want you to leave... can you complete your task and survive? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/09c74586fdb8a83de64154b4b14e7311.avif?t=1787620625\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new areas and make friends! Some may become besties, or your worst <i>NIGHTMARE</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/97ffb91a00a3fba13260fe97771fc530.avif?t=1787620625\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fishing and gardening to underground fights, enjoy a variety of <i>FUN MINIGAMES</i>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/extras/94b08009017fde8e6c9b2d2c96776f3b.avif?t=1787620625\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world... NOTHING is what it seems, and you must survive to uncover <i>the truth</i>. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices to experience different interactions! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-packed and creepy animated cutscenes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find COLLECTIBLES to uncover the hidden story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect FIGURINES of your favorite characters!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Skye and her Handy Pals are looking for a new pal to help them out on her lovely lil' garden! Think you're up for the job, partner?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, French, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Swedish, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/header.jpg?t=1787620625", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787620625", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787620625", "website": "https://www.pichongames.com/bunnygraveyard", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-compatible GPU (Intel HD Graphi